WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.520
Favorite moment filming
Season 2, and why.

00:00:03.520 --> 00:00:05.120
Let's start with you, Joey.

00:00:05.120 --> 00:00:07.800
Favorite moment, crumbs!

00:00:07.800 --> 00:00:10.040
Um, I think it was
probably actually...

00:00:10.040 --> 00:00:12.520
what sticks in my mind
is my first day of shooting

00:00:12.520 --> 00:00:13.880
after the pandemic.

00:00:13.880 --> 00:00:16.040
Just coming back,
and I was...

00:00:16.040 --> 00:00:18.640
we were halfway up a mountain
in the Lake District,

00:00:18.640 --> 00:00:20.360
and it was just
the first time that...

00:00:20.360 --> 00:00:21.880
I guess you guys had done
a bit of shooting

00:00:21.880 --> 00:00:23.280
before the hiatus,

00:00:23.280 --> 00:00:25.240
and then I was sitting
around in my room

00:00:25.240 --> 00:00:26.800
for six, eight months,
and I don't know,

00:00:26.800 --> 00:00:28.200
it was a really--

00:00:28.200 --> 00:00:29.720
it was a complicated scene,

00:00:29.720 --> 00:00:31.480
and there was
an awful lot of dialogue,

00:00:31.480 --> 00:00:33.560
and I was just
freezing my pants off

00:00:33.560 --> 00:00:37.640
in a lake in the middle
of January, whenever it was.

00:00:37.640 --> 00:00:39.600
Looking ripped!

00:00:39.600 --> 00:00:41.960
Is that all you did,
sit-ups the whole time?

00:00:41.960 --> 00:00:44.520
I just didn't eat.

00:00:44.520 --> 00:00:47.280
It's not that hard, uh...

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:48.880
But yeah, that was
really, really fun,

00:00:48.880 --> 00:00:50.960
'cause it was the first time
I'd seen you in a while,

00:00:50.960 --> 00:00:53.400
and it just felt like
coming home again, you know?

00:00:53.400 --> 00:00:54.760
Just all the pals,

00:00:54.760 --> 00:00:57.400
all your friends and colleagues
that you've not seen in so long.

00:00:57.400 --> 00:00:59.320
It just... yeah, that stayed
with me for a while.

00:00:59.320 --> 00:01:01.240
It was so wonderful.

00:01:01.240 --> 00:01:02.920
Anya, what was your
favorite moment?

00:01:02.920 --> 00:01:04.960
Um, my favorite moment was
probably the aqueducts.

00:01:04.960 --> 00:01:06.840
I loved working with
the team that I did--

00:01:06.840 --> 00:01:10.480
Eamon, Kevin, Jamal,
it was a really special scene.

00:01:10.480 --> 00:01:12.880
-Freya?
-Um, I would just say

00:01:12.880 --> 00:01:17.240
all the times when it was
me with all the Witchers.

00:01:17.240 --> 00:01:19.960
Like, I just... I just found
that dynamic so funny.

00:01:19.960 --> 00:01:25.240
Like, me amongst all these,
like, 6-foot-2 men.

00:01:25.240 --> 00:01:27.000
Just, like, little me
in a white dress.

00:01:27.000 --> 00:01:28.440
There's just, like,
something about it

00:01:28.440 --> 00:01:30.240
which was hysterical,
and so,

00:01:30.240 --> 00:01:31.680
I felt like
I could just tease them all,

00:01:31.680 --> 00:01:34.240
'cause I was in that sort of--
I don't know.

00:01:34.240 --> 00:01:35.240
They were like
my older brothers,

00:01:35.240 --> 00:01:36.840
all of them.

00:01:36.840 --> 00:01:38.480
Yeah. And it really called back
to that Knucklebones scene

00:01:38.480 --> 00:01:40.720
we see, like, in the very,
very beginning of Season 1.

00:01:40.720 --> 00:01:43.120
You really have come
your tomboy way.

00:01:43.120 --> 00:01:44.600
Yeah, exactly.

00:01:44.600 --> 00:01:46.360
And Henry,
what was your favorite scene?

00:01:46.360 --> 00:01:48.600
Um, it's--I mean,
tough to say favorite scene,

00:01:48.600 --> 00:01:49.600
to be honest.

00:01:49.600 --> 00:01:50.880
Tough to say favorite moment.

00:01:50.880 --> 00:01:54.760
But I think
my favorite moment...

00:01:54.760 --> 00:01:57.600
or my favorite time was
during the Lake District.

00:01:57.600 --> 00:02:00.960
It was so stunning up there.

00:02:00.960 --> 00:02:01.880
It just felt like a hobbit

00:02:01.880 --> 00:02:02.800
was gonna walk around the corner

00:02:02.800 --> 00:02:04.440
every five seconds.

00:02:04.440 --> 00:02:06.680
And, in a good way.

00:02:10.520 --> 00:02:12.480
I loved it up there.

00:02:12.480 --> 00:02:13.680
I love location work,

00:02:13.680 --> 00:02:14.920
and I feel you can really draw

00:02:14.920 --> 00:02:16.160
from the environment around you,

00:02:16.160 --> 00:02:17.960
and we're in
a  fantasyshow like this,

00:02:17.960 --> 00:02:20.080
and you can really
transport yourself there,

00:02:20.080 --> 00:02:21.920
especially if
you're looking that way

00:02:21.920 --> 00:02:23.800
and all you have is
another character in costume

00:02:23.800 --> 00:02:25.440
and you can't see
the camera crew or anything,

00:02:25.440 --> 00:02:27.160
and you're saying,
"I'm here.

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:28.440
I'm existing within it."

00:02:28.440 --> 00:02:30.640
And that stuff is extraordinary.

00:02:30.640 --> 00:02:31.520
Like what you see?

00:02:31.520 --> 00:02:33.160
Be sure to check out
the full episode

00:02:33.160 --> 00:02:34.320
of The Witcher: Unlocked,

00:02:34.320 --> 00:02:36.800
the official Netflix Geeked
aftershow.

